I think what he is referring to is the usual way to get things to +7 
reliably: if your successive enchantments reach +6, you dull the weapon 
back to +5 by engraving one letter, then read another b?oEW to try to 
get to +7.  (Enchanting a weapon that is already at +6 has a *chance* of 
vaporising it.)  If a pickaxe was not dulled by engraving, it would be a 
bit harder to get it from +6 down to +5, or you would have to risk 
vaporisation.

Why anyone would want a +7 pickaxe I do not know.

